 "text": "Hi, how have you been? Lots of them, but the simplest is usually the one that works for you. Do you need quiet ears or a gentle reminder? Then an earbud one ear keeps the sound private without isolating you from the world. You can turn it up when the auds get loud. You can use apps like white noise or sound baths fill the room with sound so the earbud doesn't feel like an escape. Or you can get earbud in one ear only. It' a great option if you can get it. The quiet and the books are yours completely.",
